


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_7c3f4b07:



    voice "2FU_1141"
    fumi "「妈妈发了信息，让我为亚瑟的事情道谢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_802102bc:


    "文说着，又一次向两人深深鞠躬。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_0f00edd1:



    voice "2RI_1532"
    rin "「不用了啦。已经拿了不少回礼了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_76b13b61:



    voice "2FU_1142"
    fumi "「就送了些现成的东西真是不好意思」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_3fa52a2b:


    "那之后，阳菜和伦把亚瑟带到店里，交给了文。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_ad161861:


    "因为店里还在忙，文的双亲没能直接来见阳菜两人，但作为代理的文给了她们大量的点心作为谢礼。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_19e69c4d:



    voice "2HI_1530"
    hina "「你这下可不会说收成不好了吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_d3c3ee2e:



    voice "2MI_1043"
    miyako "「收成不好？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_405e9750:



    voice "2HI_1531"
    hina "「嗯。伦可过分了哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_0f62945a:



    voice "2RI_1533"
    rin "「什么嘛，说得这么难听」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_90bc76fb:



    voice "2HI_1532"
    hina "「我们带着亚瑟出教堂的时候碰到了本条同学」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_9b8f0aed:



    voice "2FU_1143"
    fumi "「是同班的那位本条同学？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_d9937b96:


    "阳菜点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_7c2004a1:



    voice "2HI_1533"
    hina "「本条同学一直在等伦，想要把巧克力送给她」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_3e10f783:



    voice "2FU_1144"
    fumi "「这样啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_f72d1b11:


    "文盯着伦，伦缩着肩膀。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_1b9ab19e:



    voice "2MI_1044"
    miyako "「然后呢，然后呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_29e82190:



    voice "2HI_1534"
    hina "「“抱歉，我不能收。我在和她交往。”」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_24c23248:


    "阳菜模仿着伦当时拒绝巧克力的样子。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_94bc9a13:


    "虽然演技很浮夸。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_52f05818:



    voice "2HI_1535"
    hina "「然后伦紧紧握住了我的手」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_b1b27b81:



    voice "2FU_1145"
    fumi "「哇，很棒呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_e6759c78:



    voice "2RI_1534"
    rin "「硬是挤出了拒绝的勇气」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_ad0c2050:



    voice "2FU_1146"
    fumi "「不明确拒绝反而更可怜」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_20fe7f19:


    "阳菜深深点头。因为她感同身受。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_88b6eb1d:



    voice "2MI_1045"
    miyako "「本条同学反应如何？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_1a4f82b3:



    voice "2HI_1536"
    hina "「虽然很遗憾但还是放弃了。没有发展成修罗场」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_3e397070:



    voice "2FU_1147"
    fumi "「嚯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_72f12bb3:



    voice "2MI_1046"
    miyako "「这不是挺好的嘛。为什么会说伦过分呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_7eb994ba:



    voice "2HI_1537"
    hina "「因为她事后多嘴了一句」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_dc05f72c:



    voice "2FU_1148"
    fumi "「……多说了什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_cf471615:


    "文问道，再次看向伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_0070c249:



    voice "2HI_1538"
    hina "「她说，“这下今年拿到的巧克力就要减少了”」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_010f60b5:



    voice "2MI_1047"
    miyako "「啊啊，所以才是“收成不好”啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_0ff16a34:



    voice "2FU_1149"
    fumi "「呜哇，是很过分呢。呵呵」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_f38169a1:


    "本来就算收了巧克力也不会吃还计较个什么劲。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_92a7466f:



    voice "2HI_1539"
    hina "「以后我会做巧克力送给你的，你就忍忍吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_8341dec7:



    voice "2FU_1150"
    fumi "「啊，到时候我来帮忙♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_31ba480d:



    voice "2RI_1535"
    rin "「诶—啊—情人节快乐」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_b5065bb7:


    "伦从收到的回礼中拿出一个盒子，递给阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_11_03bf3359:



    voice "2HI_1540"
    hina "「好敷衍！」"
